 và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/0a/90/bb/b15b9220379e6d0423ecec74d2ef557b.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/0a/90/bb/b15b9220379e6d0423ecec74d2ef557b.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/0a/90/bb/b15b9220379e6d0423ecec74d2ef557b.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0a/90/bb/b15b9220379e6d0423ecec74d2ef557b.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0a/90/bb/b15b9220379e6d0423ecec74d2ef557b.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/01/34/99/1a442852af58057222e415ee45afcce4.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/01/34/99/1a442852af58057222e415ee45afcce4.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/01/34/99/1a442852af58057222e415ee45afcce4.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/01/34/99/1a442852af58057222e415ee45afcce4.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/01/34/99/1a442852af58057222e415ee45afcce4.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/0e/48/ad/44577f7f44aa94f2cee608f13124321a.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/0e/48/ad/44577f7f44aa94f2cee608f13124321a.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/0e/48/ad/44577f7f44aa94f2cee608f13124321a.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0e/48/ad/44577f7f44aa94f2cee608f13124321a.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/0e/48/ad/44577f7f44aa94f2cee608f13124321a.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/p